        OfflineBookQuestion(2, "english", 23, "English for Today — Unit 2, Lesson 6: Words for k K to o O", "Name the five pictures for k K to o O.", "kitten, ladder, monkey, nest, orange", "The page gives one picture-word for each letter: k for kitten, l for ladder, m for monkey, n for nest and o for orange.", "কোন শব্দটি n দিয়ে শুরু হয়েছে?", "Kon shobdoti n diye shuru hoyeche?", "Which word begins with n?"),
