        OfflineBookQuestion(2, "english", 41, "English for Today — Unit 3, Lesson 3: Making requests", "What does Hillol ask to borrow from Rita?", "Hillol asks to borrow Rita’s eraser.", "He says, ‘Can I borrow your eraser, please?’ Using ‘please’ makes the request polite.", "রিতা কীভাবে সম্মতি দেয়?", "Rita kivabe shommoti dey?", "How does Rita agree?"),
